00:59:34.180 --> 00:59:38.460
<v Ryan Schwank>Honey, I think I've kind of walked into a bear trap here.
<v Ryan Schwank>亲爱的，我觉得我好像误入了一个熊夹陷阱。

00:59:38.460 --> 00:59:43.460
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周将携《This American Life》的更多故事回归。
